Ancient Stairs~
   Light...  DAYLIGHT!  Looking up the ancient stairs, you feel the
gloom and dread slowly slip away.  Even this dim light shining down the
stairwell is blinding after the darkness you have been sunk in for what
seems an eternity.  The stairs lead up and down.
